<title>UK: London gold comes off highs, closes barely changed.</title>
<headline>London gold comes off highs, closes barely changed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes at $358.80/$359.30, down five cents from Friday's London close. Edged higher, then eased back. Focused on news of Dutch central bank gold sales.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ends down six cents at $4.70/$4.72 after coming under selling pressure out of New York.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Finished down $2.00 at $362.50/$363.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closes 40 cents lower at $122.10/$123.10.</p>
</text>
